# Zero Review Policy (Product Rule)

## Intended behavior

Review workflows are **removed**, not toggled off.

| Area | Behavior |
|------|----------|
| Employee closeout submit | **Auto-final** immediately (`approved` / `reviewed`, entries `active`) |
| Owner closeout edit | **Owner/manager only** via resubmit API; employees cannot edit after send |
| Attachment / photo review | **Removed** — no pending counts, no confirm-review UI |
| Closeout approve/return | **Removed** — no pending queue, no return-to-employee |

## Server contract

- `submitStoreCloseout` always writes `approved` closeouts + `active` entries.
- `resubmit` is forbidden for `employee` role.
- Do not reintroduce `reviewEnabled`, `closeoutReviewEnabled`, `attachmentAlert`, `autoReview`, or `requireReview` settings/API flags without explicit product owner approval.

## UI contract

- No «تقفيلات بانتظار المراجعة» or attachment pending-review badges.
- Owner manages closeouts via view/edit/delete — not approve/return.
- `closeoutAlert` (reminder when employee has not closed) **remains** — it is not a review workflow.

## القاعدة بالعربية

- **صفر مراجعة:** لا مراجعة تقفيلات ولا مراجعة صور — التقفيلة تُعتمد فور الإرسال.
- **المالك فقط** يعدّل التقفيلة بعد الإرسال (عبر مسار التعديل الرسمي).
- **لا تعيد** مسارات الاعتماد/الإرجاع أو إعدادات المراجعة بدون موافقة صريحة من مالك المنتج.
